<resources>
    <string name="app_name">Mind Peace</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Mind Peace 藉無障礙之職，察當前所開之應用，於汝未用之先覆以確認之層。不讀言談、密鑰、屏上文字之細，惟問何應用至於前。盡行於汝之機，不蒐、不傳所用之錄。</string>
    <string name="channel_session_name">用之倒計</string>
    <string name="channel_session_desc">限時之用正在進行，示其所餘。</string>
    <string name="channel_reminder_name">時至</string>
    <string name="channel_reminder_desc">是次既終，以告汝。</string>
    <string name="channel_celebration_name">能持之勉</string>
    <string name="channel_celebration_desc">久不啟所守之應用，則勉之。</string>
    <string name="channel_summary_name">日終之省</string>
    <string name="channel_summary_desc">每夕顧今日與昨日所用之時。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">先止，而後開</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_body">Mind Peace 不錮全機。汝啟易溺之流應用，即覆以確認之層，問汝果欲開之否。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_p1">未開而先攔截，以免一滑而不可止</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_p2">是次之久，汝自擇之</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_p3">可先定每日之總限，再分於諸應用</string>
    <string name="onboarding_self_title">書以自況</string>
    <string name="onboarding_self_body">每為攔截，汝先見此言。書一志，或一輕語，以遺當下之己。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_self_hint">未開之先，且自問：今果需之乎？</string>
    <string name="onboarding_self_preset_1">未開之先，且自問：今果需之乎？</string>
    <string name="onboarding_self_preset_2">先止十息，再決開與否。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_self_preset_3">此非休憩，勿以滑動為放鬆。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_self_need">書數言，或擇現成之句。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_how_title">一次之用如何</string>
    <string name="onboarding_how_1">啟所守之應用，確認之層即現，暫不可用。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_how_2">擇「確定」以續，或「退出」以歸桌面。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_how_3">擇其久（一、三、五分，或自定）。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_how_4">倒計惟此應用在前則行。中道而去（歸桌面、改啟他應用），是次即終，未盡之時廢；再啟則復問。時至則歸桌面，且告汝。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_a11y_title">啟無障礙之職</string>
    <string name="onboarding_a11y_body">非汝以無障礙之職授 Mind Peace，系統不以「汝開何應用」告我。其用惟察前臺之應用、及時覆以確認之層，不以讀汝之言。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_a11y_action">往啟無障礙</string>
    <string name="onboarding_a11y_on">無障礙已啟</string>
    <string name="onboarding_a11y_off">尚未啟</string>
    <string name="onboarding_battery_title">減為系統所殺</string>
    <string name="onboarding_battery_body">倒計須於後臺默行。請許 Mind Peace 不為電池所限，系統若問，亦許通知（以示所餘之時）。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_battery_action">罷電池之限</string>
    <string name="onboarding_battery_on">已不為電池所限</string>
    <string name="onboarding_battery_off">猶為電池之限所拘</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notif_title">啟通知</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notif_body">夕省與「能持」之勉，皆由通知。是次倒計亦見於通知。今若不許，引導仍可竟；其後將於首頁再告汝。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notif_action">許通知</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notif_on">通知已許</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notif_off">通知未許</string>
    <string name="onboarding_apps_title">讀機中之應用</string>
    <string name="onboarding_apps_body">須見已置之應用名單，汝始能擇其所守。惟讀其名與其徽，以成名單，不開應用之內。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_apps_on">已可讀已置之應用</string>
    <string name="onboarding_apps_off">尚未得應用之列</string>
    <string name="onboarding_apps_action">往授讀應用之權</string>
    <string name="onboarding_lock_title">鎖後臺之任</string>
    <string name="onboarding_lock_body">或有廠家於後臺盡清應用，攔截遂廢。請依汝之機一行之，再勾以確認。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_lock_xiaomi">小米 / 紅米：近用中下拉 Mind Peace 之片，點鎖定。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_lock_huawei">華為 / 榮耀：近用中下拉其片以鎖；電池之設許後臺運行。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_lock_oppo">OPPO / 一加：近用右上鎖定；自啟之管許 Mind Peace。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_lock_vivo">vivo / iQOO：近用鎖定；後臺高耗電許之。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_lock_pixel">Pixel / 原安卓：多罷電池之限即可，不必另鎖。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_lock_check">吾已依說明鎖後臺（或確認不必）</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_title">鄭重陳辭</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_body">讀已置之應用、得通知、啟無障礙，皆為更準以守汝所擇之應用：未開之先覆確認之層，使倒計得竟，當告則告。缺其一，攔截或廢。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_offline">謹再申之：Mind Peace 絕不蒐隱私，亦不傳所用之錄。全然離線，萬事惟留於此機。無障礙不讀言談、密鑰、屏上文字，惟問何應用至於前。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_warn_title">善意相告</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_warn_body">若汝以金購此軟，則汝受欺矣。Mind Peace 固免費，索酬者非我輩。</string>
